    "id": 16,
    "role": "staff_member",
    "bio": "<b></b><b><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;\">*** YOU MUST BE LOGGED INTO YOUR ACCOUNT FOR EVENTS TO BE VISIBLE***</span></p></b><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;\">Make-Up Lab is available for League students enrolled in a regular weekly class who have reported an absence (by email or phone call) or cancelled through the Parent Portal before a missed class has begun. The lab provides an opportunity for students to catch up on missed work. A League teacher is present at all times to provide assistance. </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;\">Please sign up for 1 Make-Up Lab per missed class. </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;\">Space is limited - reservations are required.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;\">Please cancel online, or notify us if you are unable to attend. Frequently, there is a waiting list.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;\">*Level tests may not be taken at Make-Up Labs. Tests can ONLY be taken during regular weekly classes.*</span></p>",
    "photo": "https://d1nqv8xdwxria6.cloudfront.net/uploads/profile_photo/image/8079b04a-672c-49b0-823c-623632a4a93b/image_profile_x200.jpg",
